  m_text: "\"Shadow\" and \"Eurydice\" where hanging out after all the battles they
    had. They both couldn't wait to tell their parent, the other Sentaigers, what
    they were up to.\nBut then, suddenly, \"Eurydice\" got kidnapped by one of the
    monsters that feeds on her tramas. \nIt's now up to \"Shadow\" to save \"Eurydice\"
    from the monster's dungon."
